-- A sorry'd line is a proof of its goal for the rest of the block: a later
-- line cites it, and the final conclusion is matched as usual.
admit_mid
---------
l1: $ a -> b -> a $ by sorry!
l2: $ a -> b -> a $ by ax_echo [l1]

-- The admitted line may also be the conclusion itself.
admit_last
----------
l1: $ a -> b -> a $ by sorry!
